        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 16px;border-left:4px solid #3274D9;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:600;\">Streaming Ingestion Operations</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8E8E93;\"><b>Decision:</b> Is the stream keeping pace, fast, and clean? &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Scope:</b> latest simulation run &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>Source:</b> simulated sales events, 1-second micro-batches</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><a href=\"/d/bi-channel-margin/channel-revenue-and-margin\" style=\"background:#22262E;color:#B3BAC5;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:4px;font-size:11px;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid #3A3F4B;\">Channel Margin</a><a href=\"/d/bi-hospital-forecast/hospital-forecast-vs-actual\" style=\"background:#22262E;color:#B3BAC5;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:4px;font-size:11px;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid #3A3F4B;\">Hospital Demand</a><a href=\"/d/bi-fast-slow/fast-vs-slow-movers\" style=\"background:#22262E;color:#B3BAC5;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:4px;font-size:11px;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid #3A3F4B;\">Fast / Slow</a><a href=\"/d/batch-ingestion/batch-ingestion-operations\" style=\"background:#22262E;color:#B3BAC5;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:4px;font-size:11px;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid #3A3F4B;\">Batch</a><a href=\"/d/streaming-ingestion/streaming-ingestion-operations\" style=\"background:#22262E;color:#B3BAC5;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:4px;font-size:11px;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid #3A3F4B;\">Streaming</a><a href=\"/d/storage-staging/storage-and-staging-health\" style=\"background:#22262E;color:#B3BAC5;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:4px;font-size:11px;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid #3A3F4B;\">Storage</a><a href=\"/d/query-performance/analytical-query-performance\" style=\"background:#22262E;color:#B3BAC5;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:4px;font-size:11px;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid #3A3F4B;\">Query</a></div></div>"
